WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:02.150
Later.

00:00:02.150 --> 00:00:03.520
Bye-bye!

00:00:03.520 --> 00:00:05.480
See you tomorrow!

00:00:05.480 --> 00:00:07.080
Lala-chan.

00:00:07.080 --> 00:00:08.230
Sophie-san!

00:00:08.230 --> 00:00:10.110
Did you want to talk to me?

00:00:10.110 --> 00:00:13.450
Yeah. I wanted to talk about
the two other members we need.

00:00:13.830 --> 00:00:16.620
I'd like to team up with Alomagedon,

00:00:16.620 --> 00:00:18.280
but what about you?

00:00:18.280 --> 00:00:20.150
Hmm...

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:23.960
It's Aloma-sama!

00:00:23.960 --> 00:00:26.320
I can see ye are stricken by fear!

00:00:26.320 --> 00:00:29.180
The Aloma Prophecy Grimoire, chapter 3, section 3:

00:00:29.180 --> 00:00:31.710
"Those who dare gaze into the demon's eyes...

00:00:31.710 --> 00:00:34.180
...shall see the flames of hell."

00:00:34.180 --> 00:00:37.680
She said "Everyone look at me, I'm the best."

00:00:37.680 --> 00:00:38.900
You're funny!

00:00:38.900 --> 00:00:39.640
Yeah!

00:00:45.020 --> 00:00:46.570
G-Gel!

00:00:46.570 --> 00:00:50.360
Don't worry, Mikan's angel powers...

00:00:50.870 --> 00:00:52.500
Um... Um...

00:00:52.500 --> 00:00:55.310
You forgot your line again?!

00:00:57.370 --> 00:01:00.830
...will cancel out the curse
and bring you happiness instead!

00:01:03.430 --> 00:01:06.450
Those who go against me shall be cursed.

00:01:06.450 --> 00:01:07.750
And you shall be eternally cursed!

00:01:08.820 --> 00:01:10.210
A lifelong curse?!

00:01:10.210 --> 00:01:13.840
May thee be thrown about by the demon's wind!

00:01:13.840 --> 00:01:16.720
Demon Demon Deruderu Beam!

00:01:19.810 --> 00:01:22.490
You can leave it to this angel-nano!

00:01:24.350 --> 00:01:27.790
It looks like Aloma-chan has Mikan-chan
wrapped around her finger.

00:01:27.790 --> 00:01:30.640
It looked like her eyes were spinning around and around.

00:01:30.640 --> 00:01:35.860
It's possible that Kurosu-san is threatening Shiratama-san with a curse.

00:01:35.860 --> 00:01:37.400
Just like what happened with Kuma.

00:01:37.400 --> 00:01:38.820
Eh?!

00:01:40.720 --> 00:01:42.290
N-No way!

00:01:42.660 --> 00:01:45.390
I may be overthinking it, though.

00:01:45.390 --> 00:01:49.900
Anyway, we need to talk about recruiting two more members.

00:01:49.900 --> 00:01:51.770
Let's head to PriPara!

00:01:51.770 --> 00:01:52.490
Okay.

00:01:53.110 --> 00:01:55.090
I'm worried about her.

00:01:55.390 --> 00:01:56.290
Huh?

00:01:56.290 --> 00:01:57.380
Sorry,

00:01:57.380 --> 00:01:59.390
but I need to go talk to them.

00:01:59.390 --> 00:02:01.810
I need to make sure she's not being threatened.

00:02:01.810 --> 00:02:03.100
Hold on, Manaka-san!

00:02:03.100 --> 00:02:05.370
I'll be there before our concert!

00:02:05.370 --> 00:02:06.720
Head there without me.

00:02:06.720 --> 00:02:08.060
Geez.

00:03:39.330 --> 00:03:42.430
Devi & En Nursery School! Kero?

00:03:49.660 --> 00:03:51.090
Ah! There they are!

00:03:51.090 --> 00:03:54.330
Aloma-chan, Mikan-chan, wait up!

00:03:57.290 --> 00:04:00.880
For Manaka Lala to approach me on her own...

00:04:00.880 --> 00:04:04.470
Have thee finally given in to my demon's charm?

00:04:05.930 --> 00:04:07.220
Fillet?

00:04:07.220 --> 00:04:09.720
Yeah. I love pork fillets!

00:04:10.040 --> 00:04:11.490
Same here! Same here!

00:04:11.490 --> 00:04:12.560
Wrong!

00:04:12.560 --> 00:04:13.850
Give in!

00:04:13.850 --> 00:04:15.440
Give up-nano!

00:04:15.440 --> 00:04:17.440
Kero, stop!

00:04:20.610 --> 00:04:21.520
Stop!

00:04:21.520 --> 00:04:23.920
W-Wait up, Kero-chan.

00:04:27.760 --> 00:04:32.050
Anko-chan, he won't hear you if you don't yell louder.

00:04:32.050 --> 00:04:32.790
I know...

00:04:34.800 --> 00:04:37.500
The dog! We better go ge-

00:04:39.190 --> 00:04:42.850
Gel!

00:04:42.850 --> 00:04:43.630
Sit-nano!

00:04:46.340 --> 00:04:47.860
That was awesome, Mikan-chan!

00:04:47.860 --> 00:04:48.970
Hooray!

00:04:48.970 --> 00:04:50.740
Thanks, Onee-chan.

00:04:50.740 --> 00:04:51.600
Thank you.

00:04:51.990 --> 00:04:54.430
Don't run away again, Kero.

00:04:54.810 --> 00:04:56.520
Kero, you say?

00:04:56.520 --> 00:04:57.650
There's no mistaking it!

00:04:57.650 --> 00:05:01.050
This is the three-headed dog Cerberus!

00:05:01.050 --> 00:05:02.280
The hellhound.

00:05:02.610 --> 00:05:04.980
It's Kero. He's our grandma's dog.

00:05:04.980 --> 00:05:07.370
And he only has one head.

00:05:07.370 --> 00:05:09.990
His name sounds similar to the word for frog.

00:05:10.390 --> 00:05:13.860
She named him that because he looks like a frog.

00:05:15.440 --> 00:05:16.160
He does!

00:05:16.160 --> 00:05:17.580
It's Cerberus;

00:05:17.580 --> 00:05:20.170
the dog who watches over hell.

00:05:20.620 --> 00:05:21.800
Huh?
Huh?

00:05:21.800 --> 00:05:22.890
You're wrong.

00:05:22.890 --> 00:05:25.760
He's a dog that exterminated demons with Momotaro.

00:05:26.100 --> 00:05:28.260
Huh? Momotaro?

00:05:28.260 --> 00:05:29.220
Yeah.

00:05:29.220 --> 00:05:32.360
We're taking him for show and tell tomorrow!

00:05:32.360 --> 00:05:34.410
Anko-chan will be Momotaro.

00:05:35.730 --> 00:05:37.180
Miruku will be the monkey.

00:05:37.180 --> 00:05:38.520
And Kero is the dog.

00:05:38.520 --> 00:05:39.170
Yeah.

00:05:39.170 --> 00:05:40.380
I see.

00:05:40.380 --> 00:05:41.820
Show and tell-nano?

00:05:41.820 --> 00:05:43.430
I miss doing that!

00:05:45.470 --> 00:05:47.740
Want some of this bread-nano?

00:05:48.140 --> 00:05:48.860
Here-nano!

00:05:52.700 --> 00:05:54.550
Show and tell, huh?

00:05:54.550 --> 00:05:57.160
Tis a great opportunity to widen hell's power.

00:05:57.160 --> 00:05:59.120
Go see to it!

00:06:00.420 --> 00:06:03.100
Kero doesn't get along with people he doesn't know.

00:06:03.100 --> 00:06:03.840
Yeah.

00:06:03.840 --> 00:06:07.100
To accept only foodstuffs, how cheeky...

00:06:07.100 --> 00:06:10.050
I shall place a charm upon thee to compel thy obedience.

00:06:10.410 --> 00:06:13.810
Demon Demon Deruderu Beam!

00:06:13.810 --> 00:06:17.270
Now, Cerberus, show thine loyalty...

00:06:17.750 --> 00:06:19.230
Loyalty...

00:06:21.790 --> 00:06:23.720
Go ahead...

00:06:31.870 --> 00:06:33.080
He did it!

00:06:33.080 --> 00:06:35.530
Wow! That was amazing, Onee-chan!

00:06:35.530 --> 00:06:36.330
Yeah.

00:06:37.370 --> 00:06:39.830
Don't take a demon's charm lightly.

00:06:40.140 --> 00:06:41.530
Demons are awesome!

00:06:41.530 --> 00:06:42.790
Charms are awesome!

00:06:42.790 --> 00:06:45.330
Ye shall be my little demons.

00:06:45.330 --> 00:06:46.020
Little?

00:06:46.020 --> 00:06:47.190
Demons?

00:06:47.190 --> 00:06:48.420
Is it scary?

00:06:48.420 --> 00:06:49.760
It's a lot of fun!

00:06:50.110 --> 00:06:51.290
Okay then.

00:06:51.290 --> 00:06:51.930
Yeah.

00:06:51.930 --> 00:06:57.090
All right, as little demons,
ye must not perform as Momotaro.

00:06:57.090 --> 00:07:01.440
Weaving in a story about hell shall make it a thousand times more captivating!

00:07:01.730 --> 00:07:02.960
How do we do that?

00:07:02.960 --> 00:07:03.900
Very well.

00:07:03.900 --> 00:07:08.280
Allow me to share a secret passage from my prophecies grimoire.

00:07:08.280 --> 00:07:10.860
It is about a demon who collaborated with an ogre.

00:07:10.860 --> 00:07:13.820
Aloma Prophecy Grimoire, Chapter 13:

00:07:17.380 --> 00:07:19.100
Oh, that!

00:07:19.100 --> 00:07:20.370
What a cute drawing!

00:07:21.390 --> 00:07:22.080
D-Don't look!

00:07:22.080 --> 00:07:23.370
D-Don't look!

00:07:23.370 --> 00:07:24.170
Huh?

00:07:26.340 --> 00:07:28.260
My prophecy grimoire is not for thine wandering eyes!

00:07:28.560 --> 00:07:30.970
Those who have seen it shall be chased after by hell's flames...

00:07:31.390 --> 00:07:33.760
...and wander about hell for all eternity!

00:07:33.760 --> 00:07:34.300
Eh?!

00:07:34.630 --> 00:07:36.260
She said don't look at it.

00:07:36.260 --> 00:07:37.440
Ah...

00:07:47.640 --> 00:07:49.900
Ah! Kero-chan, don't!

00:07:53.900 --> 00:07:55.780
Kero! Kero!

00:07:56.750 --> 00:07:57.570
Mikan!

00:07:57.570 --> 00:07:58.740
Leave it to me-nano!

00:08:05.900 --> 00:08:09.420
Nano!

00:08:09.420 --> 00:08:11.130
I knew you could do it, Mikan-chan!

00:08:11.130 --> 00:08:12.840
Wow!

00:08:15.470 --> 00:08:16.300
Huh?

00:08:17.990 --> 00:08:20.060
I'm out of energy.

00:08:20.340 --> 00:08:21.130
Huh?

00:08:21.130 --> 00:08:22.140
Curses!

00:08:22.140 --> 00:08:24.300
Since Mikan split her bread with that dog,

00:08:24.300 --> 00:08:26.370
her strength has been snatched away!

00:08:26.370 --> 00:08:27.190
Huh?!

00:08:29.130 --> 00:08:31.190
Kero!

00:08:32.970 --> 00:08:35.170
Mikan-chan, are you okay?

00:08:35.170 --> 00:08:37.160
What do I do?

00:08:37.160 --> 00:08:39.780
If we can't find Kero-chan...

00:08:39.780 --> 00:08:42.000
Grandma will cry.

00:08:43.550 --> 00:08:46.030
The taste of human tears is like honey.

00:08:46.740 --> 00:08:48.000
Little demons,

00:08:48.000 --> 00:08:50.700
when in search of beasts you have lost,

00:08:50.700 --> 00:08:52.630
it is best to howl loudly!

00:08:52.630 --> 00:08:53.650
Eh?

00:08:53.650 --> 00:08:56.520
She said we should split up and search.

00:08:56.520 --> 00:08:58.100
O-Oh...

00:08:58.380 --> 00:09:00.310
Sound good, little demons?

00:09:00.610 --> 00:09:01.440
Yeah.

00:09:01.440 --> 00:09:02.310
Got it.

00:09:02.700 --> 00:09:03.990
Capisce!

00:09:13.770 --> 00:09:17.310
Let us proceed, separated by this blackened river.

00:09:17.310 --> 00:09:19.860
We'll search this side of the river and they'll search on that side.

00:09:19.860 --> 00:09:20.870
Got it-nano.

00:09:21.270 --> 00:09:23.400
Now then, let us go, little demon.

00:09:30.750 --> 00:09:32.960
We've got this side-nano.

00:09:33.730 --> 00:09:35.840
You're amazing, Mikan-chan.

00:09:35.840 --> 00:09:38.430
How are you able to understand everything Aloma says?

00:09:38.940 --> 00:09:41.510
Because we've been together since we were young.

00:09:41.510 --> 00:09:43.120
Same goes for Anko and me.

00:09:43.120 --> 00:09:44.140
Nano!

00:09:44.140 --> 00:09:49.610
You know, that was the first time I've heard Aloma speak normally.

00:09:50.130 --> 00:09:51.950
<i>D-Don't look!</i>

00:09:52.570 --> 00:09:54.830
She used to talk like that a long time ago.

00:09:54.830 --> 00:09:55.990
Really?

00:09:55.990 --> 00:09:57.780
When was that?

00:09:58.090 --> 00:10:00.910
Mikan first met Aloma when...

00:10:01.460 --> 00:10:03.370
...Mikan was five.

00:10:03.900 --> 00:10:06.040
Back then Mikan looked like a boy,

00:10:06.040 --> 00:10:09.710
and Aloma was a really cute and timid little girl.

00:10:11.630 --> 00:10:15.810
But, since we both loved watching PriPara TV,

00:10:15.810 --> 00:10:19.290
we got along well and eventually became great friends.

00:10:21.440 --> 00:10:27.020
So I drew the two of us singing PriPara in my drawing book as a present.

00:10:27.780 --> 00:10:31.480
<i>When we get older, let's sing PriPara together-nano!</i>

00:10:33.520 --> 00:10:35.940
<i>Aloma can't sing.</i>

00:10:36.870 --> 00:10:38.760
She turned me down.

00:10:38.760 --> 00:10:39.910
Why?

00:10:40.330 --> 00:10:43.830
Because she wasn't very good at talking loudly.

00:10:43.830 --> 00:10:45.330
Just like Anko!

00:10:45.330 --> 00:10:46.870
I'm the opposite.

00:10:47.430 --> 00:10:48.800
However,

00:10:48.800 --> 00:10:51.330
during one of our show and tells,

00:10:51.330 --> 00:10:54.560
Aloma was chosen to play the role of a demon.

00:10:57.770 --> 00:11:05.500
<i>My birthdate is June 6th.</i>

00:11:05.500 --> 00:11:07.980
<i>Mine is June 6th, too...</i>

00:11:10.210 --> 00:11:12.690
<i>I am a demon.</i>

00:11:13.060 --> 00:11:17.110
<i>Devidevi! Throw wide the gates of darkness!</i>

00:11:18.930 --> 00:11:21.530
<i>Aloma found her outdoor voice!</i>

00:11:21.530 --> 00:11:23.440
<i>Devi!</i>

00:11:23.440 --> 00:11:27.130
Aloma did a great job playing the role of a demon.

00:11:28.150 --> 00:11:32.320
After that, she looked up all kinds of things about demons.

00:11:34.160 --> 00:11:37.330
And that's about the time she started writing her prophecy grimoires-nano.

00:11:38.790 --> 00:11:43.340
When Aloma became a demon and started talking with a louder voice,

00:11:43.710 --> 00:11:47.310
the two of us started pretending
to be demon and angel.

00:11:49.310 --> 00:11:52.140
<i> Huh? Become demon and angel idols?</i>

00:11:52.140 --> 00:11:53.690
<i>Yeah.</i>

00:11:53.690 --> 00:11:56.730
<i>One day we shall rule over PriPara.</i>

00:11:56.730 --> 00:11:59.610
<i>That's why I want you to be an angel.</i>

00:11:59.610 --> 00:12:01.090
<i>Okay-nano!</i>

00:12:01.090 --> 00:12:05.550
<i>If that's what you want,
we shall play demon and angel together!</i>

00:12:10.910 --> 00:12:14.250
And ever since then, Aloma has always spoken like a demon.

00:12:14.250 --> 00:12:15.960
How interesting.

00:12:16.330 --> 00:12:19.640
You really love Aloma-chan, don't you, Mikan-chan?

00:12:19.640 --> 00:12:22.380
You even became an angel so you could be together.

00:12:22.380 --> 00:12:23.330
Nano!

00:12:23.330 --> 00:12:24.680
What a nice story...

00:12:25.210 --> 00:12:27.140
But we're looking for Kero, you know.

00:12:28.580 --> 00:12:30.600
C-Capisce.

00:12:31.390 --> 00:12:32.870
Kero...

00:12:33.980 --> 00:12:37.060
Where are you, Kero?

00:12:37.060 --> 00:12:40.530
My little demon, the dog won't be able to hear thee like that.

00:12:40.530 --> 00:12:42.330
Kero...

00:12:42.330 --> 00:12:44.820
Thou need to yell louder.

00:12:44.820 --> 00:12:46.670
This is the best I can do.

00:12:48.240 --> 00:12:51.440
Then I shall bestow power upon thee.

00:12:51.440 --> 00:12:52.200
Huh?

00:12:52.560 --> 00:12:56.920
Demon Demon Deruderu Beam!

00:12:59.230 --> 00:13:02.340
All right, I've implanted a demonic voice within thee.

00:13:03.150 --> 00:13:04.620
Really?

00:13:04.620 --> 00:13:06.300
Thou want to reach Kero, right?

00:13:07.450 --> 00:13:08.270
Yeah.

00:13:11.720 --> 00:13:13.490
Now call to him.

00:13:13.490 --> 00:13:14.360
O-Okay...

00:13:14.360 --> 00:13:18.230
B-But I'm afraid to, so yell with me, Onee-chan.

00:13:18.230 --> 00:13:19.730
Don't call me Onee-chan.

00:13:19.730 --> 00:13:20.330
Call me Demon.

00:13:20.330 --> 00:13:21.890
Then as Demon...

00:13:21.890 --> 00:13:25.330
Well, thou are my little demon, so we shall do it together.

00:13:27.960 --> 00:13:31.120
Kero!

00:13:35.220 --> 00:13:36.240
I did it!

00:13:36.240 --> 00:13:38.090
That felt great!

00:13:44.110 --> 00:13:45.680
Well done.

00:13:45.680 --> 00:13:48.270
But you said you'd do it with me, Demon-san!

00:13:48.270 --> 00:13:50.650
Thou shouldn't trust a demon so easily.

00:13:50.650 --> 00:13:52.430
How mean.

00:13:52.430 --> 00:13:54.390
It's thine fault for believing me.

00:13:54.390 --> 00:13:55.100
Eh?!

00:13:55.100 --> 00:13:57.350
What's "Kero"?

00:14:02.950 --> 00:14:05.320
I wonder where Kero went.

00:14:05.320 --> 00:14:07.470
Miruku-chan, you need to stay optimistic-nano.

00:14:07.470 --> 00:14:10.000
We'll continue looking for him once we finish our break.

00:14:10.000 --> 00:14:11.280
Okay.

00:14:11.620 --> 00:14:13.000
But I'm glad.

00:14:13.000 --> 00:14:20.200
I was worried that Aloma-chan was
threatening you with a lifelong curse, Mikan-chan.

00:14:20.200 --> 00:14:21.500
She wouldn't do that.

00:14:22.840 --> 00:14:24.460
Huh? Lala-chan?

00:14:24.460 --> 00:14:26.760
Dorthy-san. Leona-san.

00:14:26.760 --> 00:14:29.040
It's strange to see you with Mikan.

00:14:29.040 --> 00:14:30.710
What are you girls up to?

00:14:30.710 --> 00:14:33.600
A-Actually, have either of you seen a dog around here?

00:14:33.600 --> 00:14:34.180
Dog?

00:14:34.490 --> 00:14:35.930
His name's Kero.

00:14:35.930 --> 00:14:38.040
He kind of looks like a frog,

00:14:38.040 --> 00:14:39.390
and he's about this big.

00:14:39.390 --> 00:14:41.020
Huh?

00:14:41.020 --> 00:14:43.150
Could it have been the dog we saw a little bit ago?

00:14:43.150 --> 00:14:45.810
You even said it looked like an eel.

00:14:45.810 --> 00:14:46.840
Oh yeah.

00:14:46.840 --> 00:14:48.780
Now that you say frog, it kind of did.

00:14:48.780 --> 00:14:49.360
Yeah.

00:14:49.360 --> 00:14:50.820
Really?!

00:14:57.510 --> 00:14:58.910
Ah, it's Kero!

00:14:58.910 --> 00:15:00.190
We really was here!

00:15:00.190 --> 00:15:01.540
That's great.

00:15:04.390 --> 00:15:06.620
Hold on-nano!

00:15:06.620 --> 00:15:08.350
Kero!

00:15:11.970 --> 00:15:14.100
Kero!

00:15:14.100 --> 00:15:15.180
I got ya!

00:15:15.180 --> 00:15:18.270
All right, time to take you back to your grandma's place-nano!

00:15:21.830 --> 00:15:23.400
Gel!

00:15:23.980 --> 00:15:25.370
What?

00:15:25.370 --> 00:15:26.360
Mikan-chan!

00:15:26.360 --> 00:15:31.840
No way-nano! Snakes are...

00:15:32.820 --> 00:15:36.140
P-Please help her, shopkeeper!

00:15:36.140 --> 00:15:37.580
Please!

00:15:37.580 --> 00:15:38.790
Eh?!

00:15:38.790 --> 00:15:40.200
Mikan!

00:15:41.000 --> 00:15:43.740
Save me-nano!

00:15:45.020 --> 00:15:47.710
Please save her, Demon-san.

00:15:47.710 --> 00:15:49.380
I'm also...

00:15:49.380 --> 00:15:51.190
You'll be fine!

00:15:51.190 --> 00:15:55.220
Demon Demon Deruderu Beam!

00:15:56.680 --> 00:15:58.520
I-I'm coming, Mikan-chan.

00:15:58.520 --> 00:16:01.730
H-Hey! Go away!

00:16:01.730 --> 00:16:03.480
My descendents of darkness!

00:16:03.810 --> 00:16:04.940
Aloma!

00:16:04.940 --> 00:16:06.320
Aloma-chan!

00:16:06.830 --> 00:16:11.200
Those who have been revived from the depths of the ancient darkness, I command ye!

00:16:11.200 --> 00:16:13.460
Return to the nest from whence ye came!

00:16:13.460 --> 00:16:14.990
Deroderosaimu!

00:16:14.990 --> 00:16:17.390
I am a demon!

00:16:17.390 --> 00:16:18.950
Derodero derosaimu!

00:16:19.350 --> 00:16:23.110
Derodero... derosaimu...

00:16:25.570 --> 00:16:28.120
Dero... dero...

00:16:29.590 --> 00:16:32.090
D-Devi!

00:16:32.090 --> 00:16:33.550
Aloma!

00:16:34.960 --> 00:16:37.240
Return to the nest from whence ye came.

00:16:37.240 --> 00:16:38.700
Aloma-chan, in here!

00:16:38.700 --> 00:16:39.510
Devi!

00:16:41.700 --> 00:16:44.620
Don't run away again, Kero.

00:16:44.620 --> 00:16:45.470
Kero?

00:16:46.440 --> 00:16:48.270
Aloma!

00:16:48.270 --> 00:16:49.740
Thank you-nano!

00:16:49.740 --> 00:16:51.360
You really are nice-nano!

00:16:51.690 --> 00:16:55.320
If you underestimate me, I'll curse you for life.

00:16:55.320 --> 00:16:56.240
Huh?

00:16:56.240 --> 00:16:57.780
Curse you for life?

00:16:57.780 --> 00:17:01.080
You see, it means they'll be friends forever.

00:17:01.080 --> 00:17:01.830
Huh?

00:17:01.830 --> 00:17:04.290
You understand what Aloma-chan's saying?

00:17:04.600 --> 00:17:06.250
A little bit.

00:17:07.530 --> 00:17:10.350
Kurosu-san is nicer than I expected.

00:17:10.350 --> 00:17:11.170
She's cool.

00:17:11.480 --> 00:17:12.200
Huh?

00:17:12.200 --> 00:17:15.130
President, Sophie-san... When did you two get here?

00:17:15.130 --> 00:17:16.490
More importantly,

00:17:16.490 --> 00:17:19.280
our PriPara concert is about to start,
so we have to get going.

00:17:19.280 --> 00:17:20.720
Oh, you're right!

00:17:20.720 --> 00:17:22.850
Let's all go to PriPara together!

00:17:22.850 --> 00:17:24.640
Aloma-chan! Mikan-chan!

00:17:24.640 --> 00:17:25.740
Yeah.

00:17:25.740 --> 00:17:28.650
We shall head to hell together.

00:17:32.690 --> 00:17:35.700
Please scan the appropriate number
of My Tickets for your coord.

00:17:36.530 --> 00:17:38.950
You can also scan each other's Friend Tickets.

00:17:39.660 --> 00:17:41.530
Coord Change Start!

00:17:47.130 --> 00:17:49.670
Sweet Angel White Coord!

00:17:50.070 --> 00:17:52.500
Cheeky Little Succubus Coord!

00:17:52.970 --> 00:17:54.750
Devi!
Gel!

00:18:40.260 --> 00:18:44.400
Making Drama Switch On!

00:18:45.000 --> 00:18:45.850
Pass!

00:18:46.690 --> 00:18:47.560
Take this!

00:18:49.390 --> 00:18:51.060
Go for it!

00:18:51.700 --> 00:18:56.280
Fresh Happiness Angel à la mode!

00:18:56.280 --> 00:18:57.840
Don't mind if I do-

00:19:00.630 --> 00:19:02.820
Delicious!

00:19:05.290 --> 00:19:08.060
Go, my servants!

00:19:08.060 --> 00:19:10.750
When called, we'll fly out!

00:19:10.750 --> 00:19:12.460
Huh?

00:19:14.160 --> 00:19:18.490
Dazzling PriParapedia Labyrinth!

00:19:18.490 --> 00:19:20.540
How fun!

00:19:21.990 --> 00:19:25.320
Cyalume Change!

00:19:30.560 --> 00:19:31.980
Gel!

00:19:50.350 --> 00:19:52.950
May ye rest in hell, my little lambs.

00:19:52.950 --> 00:19:55.430
May heaven bless all of you.

00:19:56.040 --> 00:19:58.490
Devil-san is so cool!

00:19:58.490 --> 00:19:59.300
Yeah.

00:19:59.630 --> 00:20:03.360
Both Aloma-chan and Mikan-chan are shining with friendship power!

00:20:03.360 --> 00:20:05.210
They sure are dedicated!

00:20:05.210 --> 00:20:07.120
I-I suppose they are-pri.

00:20:07.120 --> 00:20:09.270
This isn't the time to be awestruck-kuma!

00:20:09.630 --> 00:20:14.730
There are five person teams entering the
Dream Theatre Concert left and right-kuma.

00:20:15.070 --> 00:20:17.370
You guys need to figure out what you're doing on the double-kuma!

00:20:17.370 --> 00:20:18.530
Shut it-pri!

00:20:18.530 --> 00:20:19.690
We already know-pri!

00:20:19.690 --> 00:20:22.060
Alomagedon isn't that bad.

00:20:22.060 --> 00:20:23.270
Suppose so.

00:20:23.270 --> 00:20:24.650
Don't you agree, Leona?

00:20:24.650 --> 00:20:25.740
If you both say so.

00:20:26.120 --> 00:20:28.410
I agree-usa! They're great-usa!

00:20:28.410 --> 00:20:30.010
Teamwork.

00:20:30.010 --> 00:20:33.620
It's time for Dressing Parfait to work on forming a Dream Team!

00:20:33.620 --> 00:20:34.600
To the max!

00:20:34.600 --> 00:20:35.960
Yeah!

00:20:37.320 --> 00:20:39.130
Angel snap!

00:20:39.130 --> 00:20:41.130
Demon snap.

00:20:42.000 --> 00:20:46.210
The time when we reign over PriPara is steadily approaching.

00:20:46.210 --> 00:20:48.350
We await god's blessing.

00:20:50.810 --> 00:20:55.770
Now, you three, leave from this demonic country and become friends with everyone.

00:20:55.770 --> 00:20:56.890
I will-saru.

00:20:56.890 --> 00:20:58.400
I will-kiji.

00:20:59.190 --> 00:21:00.760
Momotaro-kun.

00:21:00.760 --> 00:21:02.150
That was entertaining!

00:21:02.150 --> 00:21:06.130
For an ogre, a demon, and an angel to become friends...

00:21:06.130 --> 00:21:07.790
What a wonderful play.

00:21:07.790 --> 00:21:09.540
Aloma wrote it-nano.

00:21:09.540 --> 00:21:11.120
Ah, that makes sense.

00:21:11.120 --> 00:21:13.800
Thanks, Onee-chan!

00:21:13.800 --> 00:21:15.790
Be cursed forever!

00:21:16.890 --> 00:21:18.240
Don't act so friendly.

00:21:18.240 --> 00:21:19.750
Leave it to us-nano!

00:21:21.010 --> 00:21:23.610
So President, Sophie-san...

00:21:23.610 --> 00:21:28.050
I'd really like to team up with Aloma-chan and Mikan-chan.

00:21:28.050 --> 00:21:29.020
Eh?

00:21:29.020 --> 00:21:29.720
Sure.

00:21:30.180 --> 00:21:33.930
Well, I suppose they have their good points.

00:23:06.530 --> 00:23:07.820
Gel-gel!

00:23:07.820 --> 00:23:09.850
It's almost June 6th!

00:23:09.850 --> 00:23:11.950
Which means it's almost Aloma's birthday-nano!

00:23:11.950 --> 00:23:13.700
Then we need to have a party!

00:23:13.700 --> 00:23:16.320
Will you help me with the party?

00:23:16.320 --> 00:23:17.330
Capisce!

00:23:17.330 --> 00:23:19.960
You shouldn't be so happy about it-pri.

00:23:19.960 --> 00:23:21.710
You've got it all wrong.

00:23:21.710 --> 00:23:23.540
Let's go to the party together.

00:23:23.540 --> 00:23:26.770
That way we can catch Alomagedon
and form a Dream Team.

00:23:26.770 --> 00:23:29.100
I'm against it-pri!

00:23:29.100 --> 00:23:29.860
Next time:

00:23:29.860 --> 00:23:31.800
Keep it a Secret From Aloma-nano!

00:23:31.800 --> 00:23:33.130
Aim for your dreams!

00:23:33.130 --> 00:23:34.760
Let's go PriPara!
